---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="The AGI Elevator // Timeline Edition"
  description="Three-layer AGI framing: story, strategy, and system log."
  theme="agi"
  bodyClass="agi-elevator-tiktok-page"
>
  <section class="elevator">
    <header class="elevator__top">
      <div>
        <p class="elevator__kicker">Timeline edition</p>
        <h1>The AGI Elevator</h1>
        <p id="subtitle" class="elevator__subtitle">Timeline mode: Story</p>
        <p class="elevator__cue">TikTok cue: compact scenes, strong hooks, stacked progression.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="elevator__modes" role="group" aria-label="AGI elevator modes">
        <button id="btn-story" type="button" class="elevator__pill is-active" aria-pressed="true">Level 1 · Story</button>
        <button id="btn-strategy" type="button" class="elevator__pill" aria-pressed="false">Level 2 · Strategy</button>
        <button id="btn-syslog" type="button" class="elevator__pill" aria-pressed="false">Level 3 · System Log</button>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="card elevator__sequence" aria-label="Authored chapter sequence">
      <div class="elevator__sequence-head">
        <p class="elevator__kicker">Chapter run</p>
        <p class="elevator__sequence-count">
          Step <span data-sequence-index>1</span> / <span data-sequence-total>3</span>
        </p>
      </div>
      <h2 data-sequence-title>Story mode</h2>
      <p class="elevator__muted" data-sequence-summary>
        Start with a single public frame, then deepen into strategy and system constraints.
      </p>
      <div class="elevator__sequence-controls">
        <button id="btn-prev-mode" type="button" class="elevator__sequence-button">Previous chapter</button>
        <button id="btn-next-mode" type="button" class="elevator__sequence-button">Next chapter</button>
      </div>
      <ol class="elevator__sequence-map" aria-label="Chapter map">
        <li><button type="button" data-sequence-target="story" class="is-active">Story</button></li>
        <li><button type="button" data-sequence-target="strategy">Strategy</button></li>
        <li><button type="button" data-sequence-target="syslog">System Log</button></li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section class="card elevator__panel">
      <div class="elevator__panel-head">
        <div>
          <p class="elevator__kicker">Infographic</p>
          <h2>The Trajectory of Machine Intelligence</h2>
          <p class="elevator__muted">2026 strategic assessment · consensus window: <strong>2028-2032</strong></p>
        </div>
        <p class="elevator__muted elevator__small">From your AGI base report blocks: vibe shift, ambiguity barrier, energy wall.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="elevator__grid elevator__grid--3">
        <article class="card elevator__mini">
          <p class="elevator__kicker">Now</p>
          <h3>2026 = Construction Site</h3>
          <p class="elevator__muted">Reasoners + agents are scaling, but reliability remains brittle.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card elevator__mini">
          <p class="elevator__kicker">Core Barrier</p>
          <h3>Ambiguity Gap</h3>
          <p class="elevator__muted">Closed benchmarks saturate faster than open-ended discovery tasks.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card elevator__mini">
          <p class="elevator__kicker">Hard Constraint</p>
          <h3>Energy / Compute Wall</h3>
          <p class="elevator__muted">Infrastructure timelines now throttle capability deployment.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="view-story" class="elevator__view">
      <div class="elevator__grid elevator__grid--2">
        <article class="card elevator__panel">
          <p class="elevator__kicker">Level 1</p>
          <h2>Story Mode</h2>
          <p class="elevator__muted">Magic → Construction → Power Plant.</p>

          <div class="elevator__timeline">
            <div class="elevator__timeline-item">
              <span class="elevator__dot"></span>
              <h3>2024 · The Magic Trick</h3>
              <p class="elevator__muted">Generative AI shocks the public narrative.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="elevator__timeline-item">
              <span class="elevator__dot"></span>
              <h3>2026 · The Construction Site</h3>
              <p class="elevator__muted">Industrial hardening and engineering constraints dominate.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="elevator__timeline-item">
              <span class="elevator__dot"></span>
              <h3>2030 · The Power Plant</h3>
              <p class="elevator__muted">Infrastructure convergence unlocks broad-scale deployment.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="card elevator__panel">
          <p class="elevator__kicker">Capability Overview</p>
          <h2>Jagged Frontier Snapshot</h2>
          <div class="elevator__bars">
            <div>
              <div class="elevator__bar-meta"><span>GPQA</span><strong>92.4%</strong></div>
              <div class="elevator__bar"><span style="width:92.4%"></span></div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="elevator__bar-meta"><span>HLE</span><strong>53.1%</strong></div>
              <div class="elevator__bar"><span style="width:53.1%"></span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="elevator__muted">Gap shown as the ambiguity barrier between structured and open-ended reasoning.</p>
          <div class="elevator__chart-wrap">
            <canvas id="chartStory"></canvas>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="view-strategy" class="elevator__view is-hidden">
      <article class="card elevator__panel">
        <div class="elevator__panel-head">
          <div>
            <p class="elevator__kicker">Level 2</p>
            <h2>Strategy Mode</h2>
            <p class="elevator__muted">Breakthrough narrative shifts to scaling and engineering.</p>
          </div>
          <p class="elevator__muted elevator__small">Consensus window: <strong>2028-2032</strong></p>
        </div>
        <div class="elevator__grid elevator__grid--3">
          <article class="card elevator__mini">
            <p class="elevator__kicker">Phase 1</p>
            <h3>Agentic Stumble</h3>
            <p class="elevator__muted">Capability high, long-horizon reliability inconsistent.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card elevator__mini">
            <p class="elevator__kicker">Phase 2</p>
            <h3>Infra Convergence</h3>
            <p class="elevator__muted">Energy and substrate upgrades catch up to model ambition.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card elevator__mini">
            <p class="elevator__kicker">Phase 3</p>
            <h3>Moment of Truth</h3>
            <p class="elevator__muted">HLMI window drives org-scale automation questions.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section id="view-syslog" class="elevator__view is-hidden">
      <article class="card elevator__panel elevator__syslog">
        <p class="elevator__kicker">Level 3</p>
        <h2>System Log Mode</h2>
        <p class="elevator__muted">Engineering_Core style summary with key milestones.</p>
        <div class="elevator__log">
          <p>[LIVE] HLE_BENCH: 53.1%</p>
          <p>[LIVE] GPQA_SCORE: 92.4%</p>
          <p>[WINDOW] 2028-2032</p>
          <p>[ALERT] Energy constraints force infrastructure-first strategy.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="elevator__log">
          <p>[2026-01] WORLD_MODEL grounding improves.</p>
          <p>[2026-02] Autonomous maintenance behaviors emerge in robotics.</p>
          <p>[2027-03?] Superhuman coding workflows become accelerants.</p>
          <p>[2028-XX] Baseload + bandwidth convergence window.</p>
          <p>[2030-XX] Org-scale automation threshold.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section class="card elevator__continuation" aria-labelledby="elevator-continuation-heading">
      <p class="elevator__kicker">Continue through the archive</p>
      <h2 id="elevator-continuation-heading">Keep the focused chapter, keep the wider context nearby.</h2>
      <p class="elevator__muted">This run stays one chapter at a time, but the adjacent monitoring and archive lanes remain open.</p>
      <div class="elevator__continuation-links">
        <a href="/agi">Open AGI timeline</a>
        <a href="/ai-waves">Open AI waves checklist</a>
        <a href="/archive">Open full archive</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </section>

  <script is:inline src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js"></script>
  <script is:inline>
    (() => {
      const views = {
        story: document.getElementById('view-story'),
        strategy: document.getElementById('view-strategy'),
        syslog: document.getElementById('view-syslog')
      };
      const buttons = {
        story: document.getElementById('btn-story'),
        strategy: document.getElementById('btn-strategy'),
        syslog: document.getElementById('btn-syslog')
      };
      const subtitle = document.getElementById('subtitle');
      const modeOrder = ['story', 'strategy', 'syslog'];
      const modeSummaries = {
        story: {
          title: 'Story mode',
          summary: 'One clear narrative pass from surprise to infrastructure.'
        },
        strategy: {
          title: 'Strategy mode',
          summary: 'Operational phases and timing windows for planning, not hype.'
        },
        syslog: {
          title: 'System log mode',
          summary: 'Milestones, bottlenecks, and timestamped constraint tracking.'
        }
      };
      const sequenceIndexNode = document.querySelector('[data-sequence-index]');
      const sequenceTotalNode = document.querySelector('[data-sequence-total]');
      const sequenceTitleNode = document.querySelector('[data-sequence-title]');
      const sequenceSummaryNode = document.querySelector('[data-sequence-summary]');
      const previousModeButton = document.getElementById('btn-prev-mode');
      const nextModeButton = document.getElementById('btn-next-mode');
      const sequenceMapButtons = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('[data-sequence-target]'));

      const getCurrentMode = () =>
        modeOrder.find((mode) => buttons[mode]?.classList.contains('is-active')) || 'story';

      function setMode(mode) {
        localStorage.setItem('agiElevatorMode', mode);
        Object.entries(views).forEach(([id, el]) => {
          if (!el) return;
          el.classList.toggle('is-hidden', id !== mode);
        });
        Object.entries(buttons).forEach(([id, btn]) => {
          if (!btn) return;
          const active = id === mode;
          btn.classList.toggle('is-active', active);
          btn.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(active));
        });
        if (subtitle) {
          subtitle.textContent =
            mode === 'story'
              ? 'Timeline mode: Story'
              : mode === 'strategy'
                ? 'Timeline mode: Strategic Roadmap'
                : 'Timeline mode: System Log';
        }

        const stepIndex = Math.max(0, modeOrder.indexOf(mode));
        const modeMeta = modeSummaries[mode] || modeSummaries.story;
        if (sequenceIndexNode) sequenceIndexNode.textContent = String(stepIndex + 1);
        if (sequenceTotalNode) sequenceTotalNode.textContent = String(modeOrder.length);
        if (sequenceTitleNode) sequenceTitleNode.textContent = modeMeta.title;
        if (sequenceSummaryNode) sequenceSummaryNode.textContent = modeMeta.summary;
        if (previousModeButton instanceof HTMLButtonElement) previousModeButton.disabled = stepIndex <= 0;
        if (nextModeButton instanceof HTMLButtonElement) nextModeButton.disabled = stepIndex >= modeOrder.length - 1;
        sequenceMapButtons.forEach((button) => {
          if (!(button instanceof HTMLButtonElement)) return;
          const active = button.dataset.sequenceTarget === mode;
          button.classList.toggle('is-active', active);
          button.setAttribute('aria-current', active ? 'step' : 'false');
        });
        const url = new URL(window.location.href);
        if (mode === 'story') {
          url.searchParams.delete('chapter');
        } else {
          url.searchParams.set('chapter', mode);
        }
        window.history.replaceState({}, '', `${url.pathname}${url.search}${url.hash}`);
      }

      buttons.story?.addEventListener('click', () => setMode('story'));
      buttons.strategy?.addEventListener('click', () => setMode('strategy'));
      buttons.syslog?.addEventListener('click', () => setMode('syslog'));

      previousModeButton?.addEventListener('click', () => {
        const currentMode = getCurrentMode();
        const nextIndex = Math.max(0, modeOrder.indexOf(currentMode) - 1);
        setMode(modeOrder[nextIndex]);
      });

      nextModeButton?.addEventListener('click', () => {
        const currentMode = getCurrentMode();
        const nextIndex = Math.min(modeOrder.length - 1, modeOrder.indexOf(currentMode) + 1);
        setMode(modeOrder[nextIndex]);
      });

      sequenceMapButtons.forEach((button) => {
        if (!(button instanceof HTMLButtonElement)) return;
        button.addEventListener('click', () => {
          const target = button.dataset.sequenceTarget;
          if (!target || !modeOrder.includes(target)) return;
          setMode(target);
        });
      });

      function initChart() {
        if (!window.Chart) return;
        const el = document.getElementById('chartStory');
        if (!el) return;
        const accent = getComputedStyle(document.documentElement).getPropertyValue('--tone-accent').trim() || '#d7aa2f';
        const soft = getComputedStyle(document.documentElement).getPropertyValue('--tone-muted').trim() || 'rgba(232,239,255,.72)';
        new window.Chart(el, {
          type: 'line',
          data: {
            labels: ['2024', '2026', '2028', '2030', '2032'],
            datasets: [
              {
                label: 'Trajectory',
                data: [35, 55, 70, 85, 92],
                borderColor: accent,
                backgroundColor: 'rgba(215,170,47,.18)',
                fill: true,
                tension: 0.35,
                pointRadius: 3
              }
            ]
          },
          options: {
            responsive: true,
            maintainAspectRatio: false,
            plugins: { legend: { display: false } },
            scales: {
              x: { grid: { color: 'rgba(232,239,255,.06)' }, ticks: { color: soft } },
              y: { grid: { color: 'rgba(232,239,255,.06)' }, ticks: { color: soft }, suggestedMin: 0, suggestedMax: 100 }
            }
          }
        });
      }

      let tries = 0;
      const boot = () => {
        tries += 1;
        if (window.Chart) {
          initChart();
          return;
        }
        if (tries < 20) window.setTimeout(boot, 120);
      };

      const queryMode = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search).get('chapter');
      const storedMode = localStorage.getItem('agiElevatorMode');
      const initialMode =
        (queryMode && modeOrder.includes(queryMode) && queryMode)
        || (storedMode && modeOrder.includes(storedMode) && storedMode)
        || 'story';
      setMode(initialMode);
      boot();

      document.addEventListener('keydown', (event) => {
        if (event.key !== 'ArrowRight' && event.key !== 'ArrowLeft') return;
        const target = event.target;
        if (
          target instanceof HTMLElement &&
          (target.isContentEditable || ['INPUT', 'TEXTAREA', 'SELECT'].includes(target.tagName))
        ) {
          return;
        }
        const currentMode = getCurrentMode();
        const currentIndex = modeOrder.indexOf(currentMode);
        if (event.key === 'ArrowRight' && currentIndex < modeOrder.length - 1) {
          setMode(modeOrder[currentIndex + 1]);
        }
        if (event.key === 'ArrowLeft' && currentIndex > 0) {
          setMode(modeOrder[currentIndex - 1]);
        }
      });
    })();
  </script>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  :global(body.agi-elevator-tiktok-page[data-theme='agi']) {
    --tone-bg: #0a0910;
    --tone-bg-deep: #04040a;
    --tone-surface: rgba(18, 14, 26, 0.9);
    --tone-surface-strong: rgba(11, 9, 18, 0.96);
    --tone-text: rgba(244, 239, 255, 0.96);
    --tone-muted: rgba(193, 182, 219, 0.78);
    --tone-line: rgba(225, 111, 255, 0.24);
    --line2: rgba(118, 245, 255, 0.18);
    --tone-accent: #f452ff;
    --tone-accent-glow: #8df9ff;
    background:
      radial-gradient(38rem 22rem at 14% 8%, rgba(244, 82, 255, 0.2), transparent 56%),
      radial-gradient(42rem 24rem at 86% 10%, rgba(69, 242, 255, 0.18), transparent 58%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, #120a1b 0%, #0b0a13 50%, #05040b 100%);
  }

  :global(body.agi-elevator-tiktok-page .site-overlay) {
    background:
      linear-gradient(to right, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03), transparent 26%),
      linear-gradient(to left, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03), transparent 26%),
      radial-gradient(44rem 26rem at 86% 4%, rgba(69, 242, 255, 0.12), transparent 64%);
  }

  .elevator {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .elevator__top {
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 16px;
    background: var(--panel);
    padding: 1rem;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.85rem;
  }

  .elevator h1,
  .elevator h2,
  .elevator h3 {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', system-ui, sans-serif;
    color: var(--tone-text);
  }

  .elevator__kicker {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--tone-muted);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .elevator__subtitle,
  .elevator__muted {
    margin: 0.35rem 0 0;
    color: var(--tone-muted);
    line-height: 1.68;
    font-size: 0.98rem;
  }

  .elevator__cue {
    margin: 0.58rem 0 0;
    width: fit-content;
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--tone-accent) 36%, var(--line2));
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 0.28rem 0.66rem;
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    line-height: 1.42;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--tone-text) 80%, var(--tone-muted) 20%);
    background:
      linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(244, 82, 255, 0.22), rgba(69, 242, 255, 0.18)),
      color-mix(in srgb, var(--tone-surface) 88%, transparent);
  }

  .elevator__small {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
  }

  .elevator__sequence {
    padding: 0.95rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 16px;
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--tone-accent) 38%, var(--line2));
    background:
      linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(244, 82, 255, 0.14), rgba(69, 242, 255, 0.07)),
      color-mix(in srgb, var(--tone-surface) 90%, transparent);
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }

  .elevator__sequence-head {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.7rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .elevator__sequence-count {
    margin: 0;
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--tone-text) 82%, var(--tone-muted) 18%);
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }

  .elevator__sequence h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2vw, 1.4rem);
  }

  .elevator__sequence-controls {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .elevator__sequence-button {
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--tone-accent) 34%, var(--line2));
    border-radius: 999px;
    background:
      linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.01)),
      color-mix(in srgb, var(--tone-surface-strong) 84%, transparent);
    color: var(--tone-text);
    font: inherit;
    padding: 0.38rem 0.72rem;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .elevator__sequence-button:disabled {
    opacity: 0.42;
    cursor: not-allowed;
  }

  .elevator__sequence-map {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 0.45rem;
  }

  .elevator__sequence-map button {
    width: 100%;
    border: 1px solid var(--line2);
    border-radius: 0.72rem;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--tone-surface-strong) 88%, transparent);
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--tone-text) 84%, var(--tone-muted) 16%);
    font: inherit;
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    line-height: 1.3;
    padding: 0.38rem 0.52rem;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .elevator__sequence-map button.is-active {
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--tone-accent) 64%, var(--line2));
    color: #f7f3ff;
    background:
      linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(244, 82, 255, 0.3), rgba(69, 242, 255, 0.24)),
      color-mix(in srgb, var(--tone-surface-strong) 86%, transparent);
  }

  .elevator__modes {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.45rem;
  }

  .elevator__pill {
    border: 1px solid var(--line2);
    border-radius: 999px;
    background:
      linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.015)),
      color-mix(in srgb, var(--tone-surface) 86%, transparent);
    color: var(--tone-text);
    padding: 0.42rem 0.78rem;
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    line-height: 1.3;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: border-color 160ms ease, background-color 160ms ease, transform 120ms ease;
  }

  .elevator__pill:hover {
    transform: translateY(-1px);
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--tone-accent) 24%, var(--line2));
  }

  .elevator__pill.is-active {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(244, 82, 255, 0.28), rgba(69, 242, 255, 0.24));
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--tone-accent) 64%, var(--line2));
    color: #f7f3ff;
    box-shadow:
      0 0 0 1px rgba(143, 249, 255, 0.24) inset,
      0 10px 24px rgba(30, 11, 44, 0.34);
  }

  .elevator__panel {
    padding: 1rem;
    border-radius: 16px;
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--tone-accent) 34%, var(--line2));
    background:
      linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.015)),
      color-mix(in srgb, var(--tone-surface) 90%, transparent);
    box-shadow:
      0 16px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.24),
      inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
  }

  .elevator__panel-head {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-end;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .elevator__grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.72rem;
    margin-top: 0.85rem;
  }

  .elevator__grid--2 {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
  }

  .elevator__grid--3 {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
  }

  .elevator__mini {
    position: relative;
    padding: 0.85rem;
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--tone-accent) 30%, var(--line2));
    background:
      linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.01)),
      color-mix(in srgb, var(--tone-surface-strong) 86%, transparent);
  }

  .elevator__mini::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0.56rem;
    top: 0.56rem;
    bottom: 0.56rem;
    width: 2px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(244, 82, 255, 0.9), rgba(69, 242, 255, 0.7));
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .elevator__timeline {
    margin-top: 0.8rem;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--line2);
    padding-left: 1rem;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.8rem;
  }

  .elevator__timeline-item {
    position: relative;
  }

  .elevator__dot {
    position: absolute;
    left: -1.45rem;
    top: 0.42rem;
    width: 0.7rem;
    height: 0.7rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    border: 2px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--tone-accent) 85%, transparent);
    background: var(--panel);
  }

  .elevator__bars {
    margin-top: 0.9rem;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.72rem;
  }

